  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience a new standard of comfort with the Nike Vomero 18 ESS. Designed for the active lifestyle, these sneakers feature a plush responsive midsole that ensures a smooth ride whether you are running or hitting the streets. The breathable fabric upper provides a lightweight feel, while the durable outsole delivers reliable traction for every stride. Stay supported and stylish with the modern athleisure staple in the Nike Vomero 18 ESS.</p> <p><strong>Features and benefits:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Breathable fabric upper offers a lightweight and airy feel.</li> <li>Responsive foam midsole provides plush all-day cushioning.</li> <li>Durable outsole ensures excellent traction on various surfaces.</li> <li>Round bumper toe design adds protection and classic style.</li> <li>Lace-up closure allows for a secure and customized fit.</li> <li>Logo embellishments and color-block details deliver a modern look.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Material and care:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Fabric and synthetic upper; foam midsole; rubber outsole.</li> <li>Spot clean.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Low-top silhouette.</li> <li>True to size fit.</li> <li>Mid-vamp coverage.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet, daily training miles, and casual wear all feel easier in a pair built for soft landings and smooth comfort. The Nike Vomero 18 ESS delivers a plush, responsive ride with a breathable upper and a streamlined low-top look that moves easily from runs to everyday routines.</p> <ul> <li>Breathable fabric upper for lightweight airflow</li> <li>Plush foam midsole helps create a soft, responsive feel</li> <li>Durable rubber outsole adds reliable traction</li> <li>Lace-up closure secures the fit</li> <li>Low-top silhouette with a padded collar for everyday comfort</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers find the fit true to size with a comfortable amount of cushioning underfoot. For the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size for everyday wear, while runners who like a little extra toe room may prefer going up a half size.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for daily runs, walking, workouts, and long hours on your feet when comfort is the priority.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p> <p>Reviewers consistently describe the ride as soft, bouncy, and easy on feet, heels, and knees. The feel leans protective and highly cushioned, making it a strong choice for road miles, treadmill sessions, and all-day wear.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Many wearers say the comfort shows up right away, while those coming from lower-profile trainers may appreciate a few sessions to adjust to the higher-cushion platform. Repeat buyers and frequent runners highlight dependable comfort for regular training, walking, and workday use.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p> <p>Spot clean as needed and let the shoes air dry to help keep the upper and cushioning looking fresh.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 18 ESS - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Summit White/White/Chalk</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IO9915-100</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-a